{"id":"e5a0510b115e1b59","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md","title":"闭包上的 Hölder 函数空间及代表元","display":"df-holder-function-space — 闭包上的 Hölder 函数空间及代表元","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-holder-function-space","aliases":["58-df-holder-function-space"],"display":"df-holder-function-space — 闭包上的 Hölder 函数空间及代表元","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","[[58-df-holder-continuity.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-holder-function-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-holder-function-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-holder-function-space — 闭包上的 Hölder 函数空间及代表元"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"635eb91d8ecbc386\" href=\"?note=635eb91d8ecbc386\" title=\"58-df-holder-continuity.md\">58-df-holder-continuity.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(0,1]\">\\(\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_n(x,y)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)\">\\(d_n(x,y)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|z|\">\\(|z|\\)</span> 为实数绝对值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\Omega=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists y\\in\\Omega\\;(d_n(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\">\\(\\overline\\Omega=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists y\\in\\Omega\\;(d_n(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=\\overline\\Omega\">\\(K=\\overline\\Omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{0,\\alpha}(K)\">\\(C^{0,\\alpha}(K)\\)</span> 使用有界的实 Hölder 函数；空上确界以集合中加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 实现，不依赖 Remark 约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 上的可测函数 a.e. 等价类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S\\)</span> 在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\\)</span> 由欧氏数据唯一确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeEqual}\">\\(\\mathrm{AeEqual}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}seminorm}\\vdash\n[h]_{\\alpha,K}\\coloneqq\\sup\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\\frac{|h(x)-h(y)|}{d_n(x,y)^\\alpha}:x,y\\in K\\land x\\ne y\\right\\}\\right)\n\\quad(h\\in\\mathbb R^K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}seminorm}\\vdash\n[h]_{\\alpha,K}\\coloneqq\\sup\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\\frac{|h(x)-h(y)|}{d_n(x,y)^\\alpha}:x,y\\in K\\land x\\ne y\\right\\}\\right)\n\\quad(h\\in\\mathbb R^K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}function\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\nC^{0,\\alpha}(K)\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\mathbb R^K:\\sup(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|h(x)|:x\\in K\\})&lt;\\infty\\land[h]_{\\alpha,K}&lt;\\infty\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}function\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\nC^{0,\\alpha}(K)\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\mathbb R^K:\\sup(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|h(x)|:x\\in K\\})&lt;\\infty\\land[h]_{\\alpha,K}&lt;\\infty\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}function\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n\\|h\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}(K)}\\coloneqq\n\\sup(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|h(x)|:x\\in K\\})+[h]_{\\alpha,K}\n\\quad(h\\in C^{0,\\alpha}(K)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}function\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n\\|h\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}(K)}\\coloneqq\n\\sup(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|h(x)|:x\\in K\\})+[h]_{\\alpha,K}\n\\quad(h\\in C^{0,\\alpha}(K)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}representative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S(h,u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\land\nh\\in C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\land\n\\exists f\\in u\\;\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(h\\upharpoonright\\Omega,f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder\\text{-}representative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S(h,u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\land\nh\\in C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\land\n\\exists f\\in u\\;\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(h\\upharpoonright\\Omega,f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Hölder 代表元在闭包上取值，Sobolev 元素是商类；两者通过显式的代表元关系关联，不能直接令两个不同载体的元素相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-holder-continuity.md","status":"resolved","id":"635eb91d8ecbc386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-holder-continuity.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AeEqual}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"d_n(x,y)=\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"|z|","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline\\Omega=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall\\varepsilon>0\\;\\exists y\\in\\Omega\